      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GREYSYND SAMMY (1) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Grade 4/5 at The Meadows. Expecting significant improvement this line-up. CHILL OUT PLATE (6) lines up chasing another win after getting around the 450m at Shepparton in a slick 25.32 on August 31. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. GO FLASH GO (2) was a narrow winner last time, jumping from this same box to score by a head in a Grade 5 over 515m at Sandown. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. WAX AND WASH (3) placed two runs ago then again in the money last time when second (23.44) at this track in a Grade 4/5.",
